#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:13
msgid "At StreamSync, we take your privacy seriously."
msgstr "En StreamSync, tomamos tu privacidad en serio."

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:18
msgid ""
"This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Esta Política de Privacidad explica cómo recopilamos, usamos y protegemos tu "
"información."

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:22
msgid "0. Educational Disclaimer"
msgstr "0. Aviso Educativo"

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:23
msgid ""
"This platform is a technical demonstration for learning the Django "
"Framework. It is not a commercial entity. All simulated environments are for "
"academic purposes."
msgstr ""
"Esta plataforma es una demostración técnica para aprender el Framework Django. "
"No es una entidad comercial. Todos los entornos simulados son con fines "
"académicos."

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:27
msgid "1. Information we collect"
msgstr "1. Información que recopilamos"

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:28
msgid ""
"We collect information you provide when creating an account, including your "
"name, email address, and other profile information."
msgstr ""
"Recopilamos la información que proporcionas al crear una cuenta, incluyendo "
"tu nombre, dirección de correo electrónico y otra información de perfil."

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:32
msgid "2. How we will use Your Information"
msgstr "2. Cómo usaremos tu Información"

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:33
msgid ""
"We will use your information to provide and improve our services, "
"communicate with you, and ensure security."
msgstr ""
"Usaremos tu información para proporcionar y mejorar nuestros servicios, "
"comunicarnos contigo y garantizar la seguridad."

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:37
msgid "3. Information Sharing"
msgstr "3. Compartir Información"

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:38
msgid ""
"We do not sell your personal information. We may share data with trusted "
"partners to help operate our service."
msgstr ""
"No vendemos tu información personal. Podemos compartir datos con socios de "
"confianza para ayudar a operar nuestro servicio."

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:42
msgid "4. Data Security"
msgstr "4. Seguridad de Datos"

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:43
msgid ""
"We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your data from "
"unauthorized access."
msgstr ""
"Implementamos medidas de seguridad estándar de la industria para proteger tus "
"datos contra accesos no autorizados."

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:47
msgid "5. Cookies"
msgstr "5. Cookies"

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:48
msgid ""
"We use cookies to enhance your user experience. You can control cookies "
"through your browser settings."
msgstr ""
"Usamos cookies para mejorar tu experiencia de usuario. Puedes controlar las "
"cookies a través de la configuración de tu navegador."

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:52
msgid "6. Your Rights"
msgstr "6. Tus Derechos"

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:53
msgid ""
"You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal information. "
"Contact us to exercise these rights."
msgstr ""
"Tienes derecho a acceder, corregir o eliminar tu información personal. "
"Contáctanos para ejercer estos derechos."

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:57
msgid "7. Changes to Policy"
msgstr "7. Cambios a la Política"

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:58
msgid ""
"We may update this policy periodically. We will notify you of any material "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"Podemos actualizar esta política periódicamente. Te notificaremos sobre "
"cambios materiales."

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:62
msgid "8. Contact"
msgstr "8. Contacto"

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:63
msgid "If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us."
msgstr "Si tienes preguntas sobre esta Política de Privacidad, contáctanos."

#: app/templates/registration/privacy_policy.html:70
