"By accessing and using our service, you agree to be bound by these Terms of "
"Service."
msgstr ""
"Al acceder y usar nuestro servicio, aceptas estar sujeto a estos Términos "
"de Servicio."

#: app/templates/registration/terms_of_service.html:22
msgid "1. Acceptance of Terms"
msgstr "1. Aceptación de los Términos"

#: app/templates/registration/terms_of_service.html:23
msgid ""
"By creating an account or accessing StreamSync, you acknowledge that you "
"have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these terms."
msgstr ""
"Al crear una cuenta o acceder a StreamSync, reconoces que has leído, "
"entendido y aceptas estar sujeto a estos términos."

#: app/templates/registration/terms_of_service.html:27
msgid "2. Use of Service"
msgstr "2. Uso del Servicio"

#: app/templates/registration/terms_of_service.html:28
msgid ""
"You agree to use the service only for lawful purposes and in accordance with "
