"Términos."

#: app/templates/registration/terms_of_service.html:32
msgid "3. Account Security"
msgstr "3. Seguridad de la Cuenta"

#: app/templates/registration/terms_of_service.html:33
msgid ""
"You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your credentials "
"and for all activities that occur under your account."
msgstr ""
"Eres responsable de mantener la confidencialidad de tus credenciales y de "
"todas las actividades que ocurran bajo tu cuenta."

#: app/templates/registration/terms_of_service.html:37
